/*
  experiments/helpers.spthy -- the shared [reuse] lemma trio (repo MEMORY.md lesson 15): the key
  derivation facts proven once so every profile's secrecy pair terminates over the layered state
  space. Include BEFORE the profile's own lemmas.
*/

// the passphrase reaches the adversary only through a degraded share outcome.
lemma H_pw_stays_oob [reuse]:
  all-traces
  "All pw #c #k.
     PwCreated(pw)@c & K(pw)@k
   ==> (Ex p #d. LeakPw(p)@d) | (Ex p #d. MisdeliveredPw(p)@d)"

// a generated private key never reaches the adversary (it never leaves !OwnSk).
// [heuristic=C]: the default smart ranking wanders through the mask-gate interleavings when the
// trio's extra credulous compare rows are present; the conservative ranking closes it in seconds.
lemma H_sk_secret [reuse, heuristic=C]:
  all-traces
  "All p sk #g #k. OwnSkGen(p, sk)@g & K(sk)@k ==> F"

// STRUCTURAL (no adversary reasoning): the key a message is encrypted to is either a key this
// ceremony generated (the DY forwarded it faithfully and the ATTENTIVE comparison against the
// OOB fingerprint passed) or the comparison was answered credulously (a Mistake).
lemma H_encto_shape [reuse]:
  all-traces
  "All m keyUsed #e.
     EncTo(m, keyUsed)@e
   ==> (Ex p sk #g. OwnSkGen(p, sk)@g & keyUsed = pk(sk))
     | (Ex p vid #d. Mistake(p, vid)@d)"
